    "body": "**Approved by the maintainer (2026-11-10): P1, open for agents to pick up.**\n\nThe open questions are answered with the recommended defaults, so a picking agent doesn't need to wait:\n- **Pages source:** GitHub Actions deploys Zola's `public/` output from the tag-triggered `release.yml` job (Pages source \"GitHub Actions\"). Nothing generated is committed. Add no new triggers.\n- **WASM timing:** ship the docs site first. Add `/app/` once #31 makes the app and UI build for wasm32; until then the front page says the browser build is coming. #31 stays its own issue.\n- **First-cut content:** the user guide (install, first run, setups, operations, posting, reading a refusal) plus a short developer section (crate map, command/undo model, gate tiers, release process) drawn from AGENTS.md and README.\n- **#291:** superseded by this issue (Zola instead of mdBook) and closed with a pointer here.\n- **Actions minutes:** measure the added minutes on the first tag run and report them on this issue.\n\nA picking agent follows AGENTS.md as usual: claim, worktree, draft PR, and `docs/decisions/688-*.md` for any further choices.\n",
